# MySQL Hospital Data Analysis Project

## Project Objective
The objective of this project is to analyze hospital data using MySQL and generate useful insights.

## Skills Used
- MySQL
- SELECT, WHERE
- GROUP BY, ORDER BY
- Aggregate Functions (SUM, AVG, COUNT, MAX, MIN)
- SQL Date Functions

## Analysis
- Total number of patients
- Department-wise patient analysis
- Hospital medical expenses
- Average hospital stay
- City-wise patient analysis
- Monthly medical expenses

## Tools
- MySQL
- SQL

## Conclusion
This project helped me practice SQL queries and develop data analysis skills.
